# Implementation Workflow

1. Read `AGENTS.md`, then open only the docs needed for the task.
2. Confirm scope against `docs/PRODUCT_SCOPE.md` before coding.
3. Prefer the smallest change that advances the current roadmap phase.
4. Do not modify `native-ai/` (Codex-owned). Document interface needs instead.
5. Do not write feature code when the task is docs/rules only.
6. Keep AR session state out of persistence models.
7. After changes, state what was tested and what remains untested.
8. Put new design decisions and assumptions in `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
9. Prefer updating existing docs over creating parallel notes.
10. Use Korean for developer-facing summaries; English for code and commits.
